{title: Hear Our Praises}
{artist: Hillsong Worship}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
[C] [Csus] [C] [Csus]

{comment: Verse 1}
[C] (Play Notes on Key/Bass/Electric) (Chords on Acoustic)
May our homes be filled with dancing |[C]-[D]-[E] - [Bm]-[D]-[E] | |[C] - G/B|
[Am]May our [F]streets be filled with [G]joy.
[C] (Play Notes on Key/Bass/Electric) (Chords on Acoustic)
May injustice bow to Jesus |[Em]-[D]-[C] - [Bm]-[C]-[Bm] | |[C] - G/B|
[Am]As the [F]people turn to [G]pray.

{comment: Chorus}
From the [C]mountains[G/B] to the [F]valleys
Hear our [Am]praises[Em] rise to [F]You, [G]
From the [C]heavens[G/B] to the [F]nations
Hear our [Am]singing[Em] fill the [F]air. [G]
[C] [Csus] [C] [Csus]

{comment: Verse 2}
[C] (Play Notes on Key/Bass/Electric) (Chords on Acoustic)
May Your light shine in the darkness |[C]-[D]-[E] - [Bm]-[D]-[E] | |[C] - G/B|
[Am]As we [F]walk before the [G]cross
[C] (Play Notes on Key/Bass/Electric) (Chords on Acoustic)
May Your glory fill the whole earth |[Em]-[D]-[C] - [Bm]-[C]-[Bm] | |[C] - G/B|
[Am]As the [F]water o'er [G]seas.

{comment: Chorus}
From the [C]mountains[G/B] to the [F]valleys
Hear our [Am]praises[Em] rise to [F]You, [G]
From the [C]heavens[G/B] to the [F]nations
Hear our [Am]singing[Em] fill the [F]air. [G] 2x

